[en.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_APPLE_TO_THE_CORE]
Apples To The Core

[en.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_APPLE_TO_THE_CORE_desc]
No matter where you go, or where you live, everypony respects a member of the Apple family. Whether it’s for their hard work, or their honest ways, or their apple tradition that go back for generations, everypony looks up to them.\nWhat? You’re not sure if you’re an Apple? If you can find a single “apple” in your family history, even just one, even if just in a footnote, you’re part of our family’s pride!

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_APPLE_TO_THE_CORE]
苹果一家亲

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_APPLE_TO_THE_CORE_desc]
无论处于天涯海角，还是居住在苹果鲁萨，苹果家族的一员永远会受到其他小马的尊敬：既是对勤劳而诚实的苹果小马的敬佩，也是对有着源远流长传统的苹果家族的敬畏。\n什么？你说你不确定你是不是苹果家族的后代？只要你能在族谱的注脚里哪怕找到一个“苹果”，你就是我们家族荣耀的一分子！

